WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.870
In Outlook's File menu, choose Print.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.530
Choose Simple Office Tools as the printer.

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:05.970
Choose Print to bring the email into the app as a PDF.

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.500
The print job completes and the email is imported into Simple Office Tools.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.330
The printed email appears as one page in Arrange.

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:15.030
The email is open in Customise, ready to mark up or edit.
